# Competency question: "What facets does GMEOW's named, parametric predicate path
# (logic:PathShape) carry?" Expected the base-step, depth-bound, namespace-scope,
# and depth-parameter properties that make a path a reusable, by-name, bounded,
# wildcard-capable traversal — the §9-extension surface SPARQL property paths lack.
# Asserted (reasoningNone) lane: rdfs:domain is stated directly in the module.

PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?facet WHERE {
    ?facet rdfs:domain logic:PathShape .
}
ORDER BY ?facet
